OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 84, writing books after
OL,4,Aretirement 'boredom'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who started writing books in his
OL,7,F80s after he got "bored" in retirement
OL,8,Fhas said other older people should keep
OL,9,Fpursuing their dreams.
OL,11,FPaul Law, from Middlesbrough, who
OL,12,Fwrites under the pen name Freddy King
OL,13,FEsquire, wrote his first book when was
OL,14,F81 and has since written a trilogy of
OL,15,Ffiction stories based on his service as
OL,16,Fan RAF navigator in the 1960s.
OL,18,FNow 84, the retired teacher who now
OL,19,Flives in Northallerton said he intended
OL,20,Fto keep writing and had just finished a
OL,21,Fseries of children's books.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
