OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 84, writing books after
OL,4,Aretirement 'boredom'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are many pitfalls and things
OL,7,Fthat could stop you and people lose
OL,8,Ftheir enthusiasm - don't let that
OL,9,Fhappen," he said.
